\newlabel{tab:gsm_results}{{5}{7}{In-domain evaluation on GSM8K ($N = 300$). Strict accuracy requires the designated delimiter \texttt {\#\#\#\# <number>}. Compliant accuracy evaluates only responses containing the delimiter. Lenient accuracy checks whether the last numerical value in the response matches the gold answer. Pairwise win rates against SFT count wins as 1, ties as 0.5, and losses as 0. Non-identical pairs subset comparisons where policy completions differ from SFT. Strict pairs report instances where verifier correctness changes relative to SFT, alongside verifier--judge agreement (where judge ties count as non-agreements)}{table.caption.26}{}}
